        Oman’s port choice has two real options — Sohar for the north and Salalah for the south — and
        the mode decision is FCL versus LCL for ocean and air versus express for time-critical cargo.
        Because Oman rates and most transit figures are not published, the table below records the
        lanes and keeps the numbers as “request a quote”.
      </p>

